  "analysis_md": "$u_x=\\frac{1+\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}},\\quad u_y=\\frac{\\dfrac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}=\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\right)},$\n\n所以$du=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dx+\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\right)}dy=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\\left(dx+\\frac{y}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dy\\right)$",
  "search_text": "设 $u(x,y)=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2})$，则 $du=(\\quad)$。 $\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}(dx-\\frac{y}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dy)$ $\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}(dx-\\frac{x}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dy)$ $-\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}(dx+\\frac{y}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dy)$ $\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}(dx+\\frac{y}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dy)$ $u_x=\\frac{1+\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}},\\quad u_y=\\frac{\\dfrac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}=\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\right)},$\n\n所以$du=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dx+\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\right)}dy=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\\left(dx+\\frac{y}{x+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dy\\right)$",
